# Chat History v3 — Latest Changes (May 2026)

## Latest Changes

### 1) Switch AI from Gemini to NVIDIA API
- **Commit**: `14a4a49`
- **Files**: `app/api/ai/chat/route.ts`, `app/api/ai/ndvi-summary/route.ts`
- Replaced `@google/generative-ai` with direct NVIDIA NIM API calls (`integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1`)
- Uses `meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct` by default, configurable via `AI_MODEL` env var
- Removed GEMINI_API_KEY dependency; now requires `NVIDIA_API_KEY` instead
- Added Gemini 429 fallback path (`c38bf97`)

### 2) Stellar API — live reads via backend
- **Commit**: `c38bf97`
- **File**: `app/api/stellar/route.ts`
- Added `get_farmer_profile` action — reads profile from blockchain, returns JSON
- Added `get_all_listings` action — pulls all live listings from on-chain data
- Simplified payload structure (removed nested `payload` wrapper)

### 3) Profile page uses backend API
- **Commit**: `c38bf97`
- **File**: `app/profile/page.tsx`
- Profile now fetches from `NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL` first, falls back to blockchain
- Submit profile uses backend POST instead of stellar tx prep
- ID upload now sends `x-goog-content-length-range` header

### 4) NDVI clamping
- **Commit**: `14a4a49`
- **File**: `app/api/verification/run/route.ts`
- Negative NDVI values are now clamped to 0 before computing buyability
- Exposes `rawNdviBps` alongside `ndviBps` in response

### 5) Polygon drawing on map
- **Commit**: `14a4a49`
- **Files**: `components/ParcelMap.tsx`, `app/explore/ExploreWorkspace.tsx`
- Added Google Maps Drawing library (`libraries=marker,drawing`)
- Rectangle/polygon toggle button in explore workspace
- Polygon vertices display and bbox auto-computed from polygon coords
- Drawing manager with polygon complete listener

### 6) Render deployment config
- **Commits**: `5f87233`, `1750098`
- **Files**: `render.yaml`, `backend/server.js`
- PostgreSQL database service (`agri-con-db`, free tier v16)
- Backend service with Prisma build + health check on port 8080
- Removed frontend from render.yaml (deployed on Vercel)
- Backend uses `npx prisma db push` + `node start.js` for startup

## Key Env Var Changes
- `GEMINI_API_KEY` → `NVIDIA_API_KEY`
- Added `AI_MODEL` (default: `meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct`)
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL` for backend API routing
- Google Maps libraries now includes `drawing` in addition to `marker`
